  "description": "<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> </div>\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-69df8d78-b998-8392-8ea2-ee9012cb4d39-1\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-214\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"87c957a3-4844-4314-bf4b-031894325434\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"466\">De Nektar Impact GXP88 is een professioneel MIDI keyboard met 88 toetsen dat geschikt is voor muziekproductie, studio-opnames en live gebruik. Dankzij de semi-gewogen toetsen met velocity en aftertouch biedt dit keyboard een realistisch speelgevoel en veel expressie. De uitgebreide DAW-bediening en MIDI-functionaliteit maken het een centrale controller voor elke muzieksetup.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"504\"><strong data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"477\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"480\">Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN)</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"819\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"521\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"524\">⭐ 88 semi-gewogen toetsen met aftertouch voor realistisch speelgevoel<br data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"596\">⭐ Uitgebreide DAW-bediening met transportknoppen<br data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"647\">⭐ 14 verlichte RGB knoppen voor MIDI en performance functies<br data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"710\">⭐ Geschikt voor studio, productie en live gebruik<br data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"762\">⭐ Plug & play via USB met brede softwarecompatibiliteit</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"1575\">📋 <strong data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"841\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"844\"><strong data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"853\">Type:</strong> MIDI keyboard / controller<br data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"883\"><strong data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"895\">Toetsen:</strong> 88 semi-gewogen full-size toetsen met velocity en aftertouch <br data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"997\"><strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1011\">Bediening:</strong> Pitch bend, modulation wheel, transport controls <br data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1101\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1120\">Extra functies:</strong> Key repeat engine, DAW integratie, RGB knoppen <br data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1208\"><strong data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1226\">Aansluitingen:</strong> USB, MIDI Out, sustain pedaal, expressie pedaal <br data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1315\"><strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1327\">Voeding:</strong> USB of externe voeding <br data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1391\"><strong data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1404\">Software:</strong> Inclusief Cubase LE (download) <br data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1476\"><strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1496\">Compatibiliteit:</strong> Windows, macOS, Linux<br data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1521\"><strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1531\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart<br data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1540\"><strong data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1550\">Staat:</strong> Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN)</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1633\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1595\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1598\">Nektar Impact GXP88 MIDI Keyboard</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1692\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1657\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1660\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>",
